049100*-------- ACCT NAME.  THE ONLY PURPOSE FOR THIS CALL IS TO KNOW
049200*-------- WHETHER THE USE OF THE 'f6' KEY (GENERATE COMPARE
049300*-------- RECORD) IS AUTHORIZED (MGR.CME ONLY).
