      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *  10/18/94           C A ZUBEK                             *
      *  LOGIC TO CALL THE SUBROUTINE "TALTKEY" TO SEE IF USER    *
      *  ENTERED AN ALTERNATE KEY.  IF SO, THE CORPORATE CODE     *
      *  WILL BE RETURNED.                                        *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

           MOVE DE-CODE-ENTRY           TO ALT-KEY-ARG.
           CALL "TALTKEY" USING RET-CODE,
                                BASE-TALTKEY,
                                STATUS-AREA,
                                ALT-KEY-ARG,
                                ALT-CORP-CODE.
           MOVE ALT-CORP-CODE           TO CODE-ARG.
           IF RET-CODE NOT EQUAL "00"
               MOVE "TALTKEY ERROR 62-UCC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           MOVE ALT-CORP-CODE             TO CODE-ARG.

           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-O.
           READ MSTORERM-O INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
076400     IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
076500         IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
