      *------4/15/97 JSB, ADD FRANCHISE ID AND NAME
           MOVE STR-CODE-OWNER        TO     DE-FRAN-ID
                                             OLD-FRAN-ID.
           SET FRAN-IDX TO 1.
           IF STR-CODE-OWNER NOT = SPACES
               SEARCH FRAN-ENTRY
                  AT END
                      MOVE SPACES TO DE-FRAN-NAME
                  WHEN FRAN-ID (FRAN-IDX) = STR-CODE-OWNER
                      MOVE FRAN-NAME(FRAN-IDX) TO DE-FRAN-NAME
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES TO DE-FRAN-NAME.
           MOVE STR-QS9000-TRACK      TO     DE-QS9000-TRACK.
